    rdf:value """Wednesday, Aug. 14, 1907
2 Morpeth Terrace, London.
Karin and Ray and Ray’s friend, Margaret Jones, came up, and we met at Dr. Heath’s. They went to the theatre in the evening.
Bernhard walked with the Rothschild crowd, and then drove with Dora di Rudini to Fex."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 248 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1907> .

